{"name":"Citadel Adbar","status":"ok","title":"Citadel Adbar","pageId":2444,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Citadel Adbar</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silver_Marches\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Silver Marches\">Silver Marches</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"demonym\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Demonym</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Adbarrim<sup id=\"cite_ref-WotW_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-WotW-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">19,962<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-172_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-172-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><table class=\"percentagetable\"><tbody><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_dwarves\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shield dwarves\">Shield dwarves</a>  </td><td> 84%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Gold_dwarves\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gold dwarves\">Gold dwarves</a>  </td><td> 6%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Humans\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Humans\">Humans</a>  </td><td> 5%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Urdunnir\" title=\"Urdunnir\">Urdunnir dwarves</a>  </td><td> 3%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Svirfneblin\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Svirfneblin\">Svirfneblin</a>  </td><td> 1% </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Earth_genasi\" title=\"Earth genasi\">Earth genasi</a> </td><td> 1% </td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Commerce</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"exports\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Exports</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mithral\" title=\"Mithral\">Mithral</a><br>Refined metals<br>Weapons<br>Armor</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Politics</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"government\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silver_Marches_Confederation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Silver Marches Confederation\">Silver Marches Confederation</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">King <a href=\"/wiki/Harbromm\" title=\"Harbromm\">Harbromm</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Locations in Citadel Adbar (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6TG9jYXRpb25zX2luX0NpdGFkZWxfQWRiYXI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Locations in  Citadel Adbar</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Organizations_in_Citadel_Adbar\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Citadel Adbar\">Organizations in  Citadel Adbar</a></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Citadel Adbar</b> was a <a href=\"/wiki/Dwarf\" title=\"Dwarf\">dwarf</a> fortress-city in the <a href=\"/wiki/Silver_Marches\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Silver Marches\">Silver Marches</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Government\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Government</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Defenses\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Defenses</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Places\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Places</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Further_Readings\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Further Readings</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Connections\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Connections</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Citadel_Adbar?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It was named for King <a href=\"/wiki/Adbar\" title=\"Adbar\">Adbar</a>, the ancient dwarf who began its construction in the <a href=\"/wiki/-370_DR\" title=\"-370 DR\">Year of Rent Armor, −370 DR</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-TGHotR-47_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TGHotR-47-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> and completed it in <a href=\"/wiki/-272_DR\" title=\"-272 DR\">Year of Songstones, −272 DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-LEoF-p84_5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LEoF-p84-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-TGHotR-51_6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TGHotR-51-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Government\">Government</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Government\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Citadel_Adbar?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Government\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When King <a href=\"/wiki/Harbromm\" title=\"Harbromm\">Harbromm</a> died, his twin sons reigned jointly, though they were unprepared for rule. Eventually, when the elder, <a href=\"/wiki/Bromm\" title=\"Bromm\">Bromm</a>, was slain by a <a href=\"/wiki/Dragon\" title=\"Dragon\">dragon</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Harnoth\" title=\"Harnoth\">Harnoth</a> reigned alone.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SCAG-p59_7-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SCAG-p59-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Defenses\">Defenses</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Defenses\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Citadel_Adbar?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Defenses\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Iron_Guard\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Iron Guard\">Iron Guard</a> formed part of the militia.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FH-p238_8-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FH-p238-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Places\">Places</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Places\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Citadel_Adbar?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Places\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The tall towers that jut above ground were called the <b>Dragonspikes</b>, so named because they protected against dragon attacks with their nasty spikes. Smoke from the <b>Foundry</b> exited out the central tower chimney. A waterwheel operated in the lowest part of the mines. Chain hoists connected the aboveground levels to the belowground levels. Access to the citadel on the surface was facilitated by a drawbridge; access to the keep from the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Fardrimm\" title=\"Fardrimm\">Fardrimm</a>, and other Delzoun strongholds was sealed off by a heavy iron portal known as the <b>Caravan Door</b>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-RGLoD-139_9-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-RGLoD-139-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade\">Trade</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Citadel_Adbar?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trade\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Surface traders brought fresh produce to Adbar and returned with metals and dwarven craftworks.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-172_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-172-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Citadel_Adbar?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"metadata plainlinks stub\"><tbody><tr>\n<td><i>This article is incomplete.</i>  <i>You can help the Forgotten Realms Wiki by providing more information.</i></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Citadel_Adbar?veaction=edit&section=7\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-WotW-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-WotW_1-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>&#160;(August 1992). “<a href=\"/wiki/The_Everwinking_Eye\" title=\"The Everwinking Eye\">The Everwinking Eye</a>: Words To The Wise”. In <a href=\"/wiki/Jean_Rabe\" title=\"Jean Rabe\">Jean Rabe</a>&#160;ed. <a href=\"/wiki/Polyhedron_74\" title=\"Polyhedron 74\"><i>Polyhedron</i> #74</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc.\" title=\"TSR, Inc.\">TSR, Inc.</a>), p. 14–15.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRCS3e-172-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-172_2-0\">2.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=